flowchart LR
  subgraph Repo[Repository]
    DEV[dev branch]
    MAIN[main branch]
    PR[feature branches + PRs]
  end

  DEV -->|merge| WD[Web staging preview]
  MAIN -->|release path| WP[Web production]
  DEV -->|trusted SHA| PA[Android Preview lane]
  DEV -->|trusted SHA| PI[iOS Preview lane]
  MAIN -->|owner dispatch| PP[Android Production lane]

  WD -->|Render health + checks| STAGING[(staging.kurioticket.com)]
  WP -->|Render deploy| PROD_WEB[(kurioticket.com)]

  PA -->|OTA / native baseline| AN[Android APK/AAB]
  PI -->|build + TestFlight submit| IOS[App Store Connect / TestFlight]
  PP -->|AAB + Play evidence| PG[Google Play Internal Testing]

  STAGING -->|manual QA| TEAM[Team]
  TEAM -->|feedback| DEV
  AN -->|Tester install| TEAM
  IOS -->|QA| TEAM
